 "title": "Red heifer ordinance, step 3 — mix the ashes with spring water",
 "summary": "Adds step 3 of the red heifer ordinance: mix its ashes with spring water. Steps 1 and 2 (find an unblemished red heifer; slaughter and burn it outside the city with cedar wood, hyssop and crimson wool) remain above.",
